---

<Layout chapter="organizing-committee">
  <ChapterHead chapter="organizing-committee" />

  <article class="prose">
    <p>
      The committee is structured into seven teams:
    </p>

    {teams.map((t) => (
      <section>
        <h4>{t.title}</h4>
        <p>{t.text}</p>
      </section>
    ))}

    <p>
      The committee already includes 28 motivated volunteers, but it is expected to grow with a big
      contribution of new volunteers before and during the event.
    </p>

    <p>
      Please note that every team has separate tasks for organizational and practical purposes, but
      they continuously dialogue with each other, exchanging ideas and information, and making common
      decisions towards the same general aim: organizing an ICPS as complete and pleasant as possible,
      making it unforgettable.
    </p>

    <section>
      <h2>Organizational structure</h2>
      {blocks.map((b) => (
        <div class="team-block">
          <h4 class="team-block__title">{b.title}</h4>
          {b.members.map((m) => (
            <PersonCard photo={m.photo} name={m.name} role={m.role} bio={m.bio} />
          ))}
        </div>
      ))}
    </section>
  </article>
</Layout>
